Problem:
David likes to mix his two post workout drinks: coconut water and blue energade. Coconut water costs $3 per bottle, contains 5 units of potassium, 3 units of magnesium, and 8 units of calcium. Blue energade costs $5 per bottle and contains 10 units of potassium, 4 units of magnesium, and 4 units of calcium. David likes to make sure he gets at least 15 units of potassium, 10 units of magnesium, and 20 units of calcium after each workout. How many bottles of each drink should he buy and mix in order to ensure a minimum cost? What is the minimum cost?

